  lineText: " |  |  | <b>SUSPECTS</b> |  | \r\n\r\nNo suspects have been gathered
    so far.<u><b>Yuki Tanaka</b></u>\r\n<b>Role:</b> Assistant Curator \r\n<b>Alibi:</b>
    She was at home at the time of murder.N/A\r\n<b>Timeline:</b> \r\n- Found the
    body- Found the body at 7:35 AM with Victor.N/A<u><b>Victor Hasting</b></u>\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Role:</b>
    Chief Security Officer \r\n<b>Alibi:</b> He was at home at the time of murder.N/A\r\n<b>Timeline:</b>
    \r\n- Found the body- Override the electronic lock around 7:35 AM.\r\n- Found
    the body at 7:35 AM with Yuki.\r\n- Reported the murder to 911N/A<u><b>Thomas
    Webb</b></u>\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Role:</b> Victim's Brother\r\n<b>Alibi:</b> He was
    at the gala at the time of murder.N/A\r\n<b>Timeline:</b> \r\n- Received N/A\r\n\r\n\r"
